    "text": "Adam has described a consistent principle across this work: AI should handle volume and variation while the editorial or decision bar remains human. His systems repeatedly encode permissions, verification states, approval gates, audit histories, rate controls, rollback, or kill switches. This is documented design behavior, not merely a philosophical claim."
