    "text": "Adam began integrating generative AI into client workflows in 2022. He has built prompt and agent libraries, standards, documentation, approval flows, and working systems; guided users; and helped move wary teams toward routine use. The strongest documented example is Agency689 Writing Systems, used in daily client work and reported to cut first-draft time by roughly half."
