    "text": "- Frontier AI can improve SEO and answer-engine visibility when it directly analyzes site, search, competitor, and structured-data evidence rather than merely producing generic recommendations. - Brand voice can scale without flattening if the system retains source context, generates alternatives, checks standards, and requires human editorial approval. - Internal tools can outperform generic software when they encode the organization's actual workflow and remain maintainable. - Recursive improvement is valuable only when evidence, approvals, and rollback prevent the system from learning the wrong lesson unchecked."
