    "text": "- AI theater, demos, and strategy without operational ownership. - Calling a governed system “autonomous” when meaningful human approval remains. - Treating AI-generated volume as a substitute for editorial judgment. - Overclaiming tools, scale, metrics, or production status. - Generic SEO products that treat AEO as an add-on rather than designing directly for answer engines. - Automation without permissions, observability, failure handling, and a safe way to stop or reverse it."
